# ── KEY MATERIAL — nothing below may ever enter this repository.
# A shielded pool custodies other people's tokens. One committed keypair is
# not an incident, it is the end of the project.
*keypair*.json
*-keypair.json
id.json
wallet.json
*.pem
*.key
*.secret
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/

# ── Proving artifacts: large, regenerable, and not the source of truth.
# The verification key IS tracked (circuit/verification_key.json) — it is public
# by construction and it is what lets a third party check the deployed program.
*.zkey
*.ptau
*.r1cs
*.wasm
*.sym
witness.wtns

# ── Build output
node_modules/
target/
*.so
dist/

# ── Generated at runtime by devnet/run.js
mint-nx.json
resultat-jetons.json
deploy-output.json

# ── Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
